# Publish bytes exactly as exported.
#
# The dashboard bundle is hashed at export time and re-verified against
# public_bundle_manifest.json by the Pages workflow. If git rewrites line
# endings on checkout, every text file fails that check with a size mismatch —
# which is exactly what happened on the first release attempt. Disable all
# conversion so what is committed is what is served and what was hashed.
* -text
